Session 6, 2026-09-05. TWO VTs LIVE SIMULTANEOUSLY (New Holland's own
built-in VT + Ag Leader InCommand 1200). Firmware: isobus-tc-client @
935de81 -- i.e. WITH the #17 fix applied and confirmed working in both
single-VT configurations (see run 1 and run 2).

THE NEW PROBLEM, filed as GitHub issue #20. With two VT-function devices on
the bus, the VT (and TC) connection cannot be held at all, and never
recovers. Reached three independent ways, same outcome every time.

Timestamps are seconds since the logging script attached to COM4; the board
was rebooted twice during this window, so board-relative time resets there.

